= The United Farmers of Canada (Saskatchewan Section) 

The UFC(SS) is a farmer's educational organization. In 1932, it's political wing, the UFPA, merged with the ILP(S) to form the FLP. 

[? if ufc_militancy >= 0.50 : The UFC(SS)'s Left Wing is currently in power. ?]

